    native_mir_lambda_and_enum_eq_block_caret_cs_2026_10_19, 0, "Same compiler, entry src/app/llm_caret/cs_main.spl reaches MIR then fails: E-MIR-EXPR-Lambda x21 (nogc_async_mut/io/buffer.spl 130,155,166,275,288,301,320,333), operator overload not found for enum-like types compared with == (RtHalOperationKind x12, RtHalProviderKind x9, FileMode x6, EnvAccessKind x6, Encoding x4), unresolved method close x7 and is_open x8 (nogc_sync_mut and nogc_async_mut io/buffer.spl). Build exit 1 after 277s, 3.4 GB RSS."

